00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:03.003
A major milestone for NASA

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:05.505
Touchdown

00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:09.542
has touchdown.

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:10.410
Space agency

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:11.878
finally has its hands

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:13.480
